+# C1/C2 sufficiency diagnostic
+
+Completion criterion: a deterministic production-label test is red with the
+primitive fallback, green with the exact path, and red after restoring the
+fallback; the final report records separate C1/C2 collisions (or a bounded
+negative search) plus held-out Q-only versus discarded-structure explained
+variance on existing real rows relabelled by the exact evaluator.
+
+Test seam: `scripts/run_v025_pilot_c3.py::_build_anchor_rows`, compared against
+independent calls to the production target definitions on exact evaluator
+singleton outcomes for real legacy-provider anchors.
